# Build context for toolchain/Containerfile is the repository root, limited
# to what the image needs: the toolchain definition and the sources of the
# workspace tool it AOT-compiles (plus every workspace pubspec, which the
# workspace resolution requires). Keep in step with toolchain/digest.sh.
*
!.dockerignore
!LICENSE
!pubspec.yaml
!pubspec.lock
!daemon/pubspec.yaml
!packages/media/pubspec.yaml
!packages/client/**
!tool/**
!toolchain/**
**/.dart_tool
